Cell["\<\
Mathematically, Lindblad supermap is a generator of a dynamical semi-group.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->486125778,ExpressionUUID->"515e4b5b-9c1b-4e07-9ac1-2d00b104c93f"],

Cell[TextData[{
